college girl, huh?

116
00:06:30,223 --> 00:06:33,101
It is more complicated
than you could possibly imagine.

117
00:06:33,184 --> 00:06:35,061
Uh, leave the bottle.

118
00:06:35,144 --> 00:06:37,105
It's a visual poem.

119
00:06:37,188 --> 00:06:38,898
