any details here.

120
00:06:38,981 --> 00:06:41,109
You know what my secret goal is
for the rest of this year?

121
00:06:41,192 --> 00:06:42,777
-What?
-I'm serious. Really.

122
00:06:42,860 --> 00:06:47,115
My secret goal
is to stop being so scared.

123
00:06:47,198 --> 00:06:50,034
-Elizabeth Weiland. For...
-HART: Those are mine!

124
00:06:50,118 --> 00:06:53,454
Jesus! That is all you get
for five dollars?

125
00:06:53,538 --> 00:06:55,039
Plus delivery, yes.

126
00:06:55,123 --> 00:06:56,207
