127
00:06:56,999 --> 00:06:58,668
Lorenz Hart?

128
00:06:58,751 --> 00:07:01,629
You know, I kind of think
I've heard that name before.

129
00:07:01,712 --> 00:07:05,508
You just earned yourself
a dollar tip, kid.

130
00:07:05,591 --> 00:07:07,885
A precedent is being broken.

131
00:07:07,969 --> 00:07:09,345
[CHUCKLES]

132
00:07:09,429 --> 00:07:11,889
Hey, she gave this to me.

133
00:07:11,973 --> 00:07:13,891
Mailed it all the way
from New Haven

134
00:07:13,975 --> 00:07:15,101
because I said
I wanted something

135
00:07:15,184 --> 00:07:16,519
she'd actually touched.

136
00:07:16,602 --> 00:07:19,105
[SNIFFS] Christ! It's like
I'm 17 again,

137
00:07:19,188 --> 00:07:20,606
except I never was 17.

138
00:07:20,690 --> 00:07:23,192
I went directly from childhood
to washed-up.

139
00:07:24,569 --> 00:07:26,612
Eddie, get the kid a drink,
would you?

140
00:07:26,696 --> 00:07:28,364
No thanks. I'm... I'm working.

141
00:07:28,448 --> 00:07:30,575
Oh, Christ, that's when
you should be drinking.

142
00:07:30,658 --> 00:07:32,577
What's your name?
Sven, am I right?

143
00:07:32,660 --> 00:07:35,371
-Troy.
-HART: Ooh, even better.

144
00:07:35,455 --> 00:07:37,373
Listen, Sven,
are you free tonight?

145
00:07:37,457 --> 00:07:39,292
Eddie, would you get the kid
a goddamn shot?

146
00:07:39,375 --> 00:07:40,334
-Yeah.
-'Cause I am throwing

147
00:07:40,418 --> 00:07:42,962
