148
00:07:43,045 --> 00:07:45,298
All of show business
is going to be there.

149
00:07:45,381 --> 00:07:47,758
I've booked
the Golden Gate Quartet.

150
00:07:47,842 --> 00:07:49,051
I'm serious.

151
00:07:49,135 --> 00:07:51,095
I want you to show up,
bring a friend,

152
00:07:51,179 --> 00:07:52,722
