"Larry, we're in big trouble.

244
00:11:44,078 --> 00:11:45,830
"I need you
to funny up the show.

245
00:11:45,913 --> 00:11:47,581
"We need some
big comedy numbers."

246
00:11:47,665 --> 00:11:49,166
And I was all ready to say,

247
00:11:49,250 --> 00:11:53,629
"Dick, instead of all this
corn-pone Americana,

